Add support for span attributes `gen_ai.usage.cache_write.input_tokens`, per-modality `gen_ai.usage.*_tokens` breakdowns, `gen_ai.request.reasoning.level`, `gen_ai.request.previous_response.id`, `gen_ai.conversation.compacted`, and `gen_ai.prompt.*` attributes on inference spans, and duration metrics `gen_ai.invoke_agent.duration` and `gen_ai.execute_tool.duration`.
